        "root_concepts": "[natural, fibers]",
        "section": "textiles",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Natural Fibers - Plant (Cellulosic)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Cotton:  ~90% cellulose, DP ~1,000–3,000 (shorter chain = weaker)\nLinen:   ~80% cellulose, DP ~8,000 (longer chain = stronger)\nHemp:    ~70% cellulose, DP ~6,000\nJute:    ~65% cellulose (more lignin = stiffer, coarser)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md#004",
      "path": [
        "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
