      },
      "text": "### The Boll and Fiber Structure\n```\nCOTTON BOLL CROSS-SECTION:\n  ┌─────────────────┐\n  │    Boll capsule │\n  │  ┌───────────┐  │\n  │  │  Seeds    │  │← 3-5 seeds per boll\n  │  │ ●●●●●●●●● │  │\n  │  └──│────│───┘  │\n  │     │    │      │← fibers = unicellular seed hairs\n  │  ~~~│~~~~│~~~   │   attached to seed coat\n  └─────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
