        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Natural Fibers - Plant (Cellulosic)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SINGLE COTTON FIBER:\n  ─ Cuticle (waxy outer layer — removed by scouring)\n  ─ Primary wall (cellulose fibrils, randomly oriented)\n  ─ Secondary wall (concentric lamellae, spiral fibrils 20-30°)\n  ─ Lumen (central canal, collapses on drying → kidney bean shape)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md#012",
      "path": [
        "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
