        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Natural Fibers - Plant (Cellulosic)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "IMMATURE fiber: thin-walled, hollow — dyes poorly, pills easily\n  MATURE fiber:   thick-walled, collapsed lumen — strong, dyes well\n  DEAD fiber:     no lumen contents — dull, weak\n```"
    },
