      "text": "### Processing: From Field to Bale\n```\nHARVEST\n  Mechanical: spindle pickers (strips seed cotton from boll)\n              stripper harvesters (strips everything — more trash)\n  Hand:       developing world — cleaner cotton, picker quality variable"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md#014",
      "path": [
        "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
