      "text": "COMBING (optional — for finer yarns)\n  Additional combing step removes more short fibers\n  \"Combed cotton\" has longer average fiber length → smoother, stronger yarn\n  ~20% of fiber is removed as \"noil\" (shorter fibers, used for cheaper goods)"
    },
