        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "This is not tangential history — it is the reason cotton industrialized when it did."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md#024",
      "path": [
        "01-NATURAL-FIBERS-PLANT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
