        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Natural Fibers - Plant (Cellulosic)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nTIMELINE:\n  1793  Whitney's cotton gin — short-staple ginning industrialized\n  1800  US cotton exports: 18 million pounds\n  1860  US cotton exports: 1,768 million pounds (×98 in 60 years)\n  1860  3.84 million enslaved people in US (up from ~700,000 in 1790)"
    },
